      "writtenOn": "2013-03-07T23:27:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem this is trying to fix is ensuring after a recovery we probably won\u0027t mis-interpret responses - that the serial numbers of the new commands will be substantially different from those in the old responses.  We could have the first generation start at 0 if you want - I don\u0027t think the recovery mechanism gets exercised very often.",
      "parentUuid": "QPkfXMLU",
      "revId": "8854b3511f551e2441344051939c79695b73aab2",
