      "side": 1,
      "message": "We will resetSerial when RILD socket disconnected.\nIf RILD socked disconnected, clearRequestsList() will clear all requests when socked disconnected. When RILD socket connected again, new serial number will start from 0, while no old requests. So I think there will no mis-interpret case.\nCorrect me if  I am wrong.",
